<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/eng@/~part_I__cl_32__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the amount of the revised 108 balance exceeds the 108 balance, or revised 108 balance as at 31 December 2013, the Director General shall serve on the company a written requisition in the prescribed form calling upon the company to pay an amount equal to that excess and that amount shall be a debt due from the company to the Government and that debt shall be payable immediately to the Director General upon the service of the requisition."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/eng@/~part_I__cl_32__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/eng@/~part_I__cl_32> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/eng@/~part_I__cl_32__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/32/eng@> .
